Z||000000||Greg Piet||02-05-2000||12:12 AM||||Well in Las Vegas Nevada USA today, a white Fiero got hit by a Ford F-150 who was drunk and ran a red light.  Unfortunately the Fiero driver was killed.  The NEWS showed pictures of the vehicles, and the Fiero didn't look heavily damaged.  The NEWS failed to mention whether the Fiero driver was wearing their seat belt or not.  I believe it was a side impact on the Fiero.  So... a moment of silence for the passing of a Fiero driver.<p>[This message has been edited by Greg Piet (edited 02-06-2000).]||||reg||1
